OL,14,     Fpast resurfaces as he investigates
OL,15,     Fthe death of a woman fleeing a
OL,16,     Fmasked man.
OL,17,G1655 Love Nature
OL,18,     FThe Devon Wildlife Trust and other
OL,19,     Fpartners are reintroducing pine
OL,20,     Fmartens into Dartmoor and Exmoor.
OL,21,     FAs predators they balance the
OL,22,     Fother animals and the ecosystem.
